# drive.defaults — GLOBAL defaults for drive.sh, shared by every feature/run.
# One-time install:
#   mkdir -p ~/.config/pipeline-driver && cp drive.defaults.example ~/.config/pipeline-driver/drive.defaults
# Sourced by bash BEFORE the per-feature drive.config, so anything here is a
# default and drive.config always wins. Keep per-feature facts (WORKDIR, BRANCH,
# FEATURE, the per-run ORCA_TERMINAL_HANDLE) OUT of this file.
#
# Slot bindings on this machine (documentation, not mechanism — CONTRACT.md keeps
# runtime binding out of roles.yaml on purpose; the operator assigns the bots):
#   prd / arch / task : Claude (frontier reasoning tier, e.g. opus/fable)
#   impl              : pi TUI via the orca transport (cheap coding model)
#   review            : codex (independent reviewer; merge confirm stays HUMAN)

# --- impl transport + model (stable across features) ---------------------------
IMPL_TRANSPORT=orca
IMPL_SLASH_CMD=/skill:pipeline-impl   # pi registers skills as /skill:<name>
# ORCA_RESET_CMD=/new                 # per-card TUI reset; empty = off
# ORCA_TERMINAL_TITLE=impl            # title fallback only — pin the HANDLE per run in drive.config
# IMPL_MODEL=haiku                    # claude transport only
# IMPL_BASE_URL=
# IMPL_AUTH_TOKEN_ENV=

# --- loop tuning ----------------------------------------------------------------
# CARD_TIMEOUT=2700
# POLL_SECS=30
# ORCA_IDLE_TIMEOUT_MS=60000
# MAX_CONSEC_FAIL=2
# RETRY_ON_FAIL=1

# --- YOLO: standing ex-ante grant (README §YOLO) --------------------------------
# 1 = record ONCE that, for LOW-RISK features driven on this machine, the
# coordinating agent may read the frozen spec and echo the spec-rev at GATE 1 —
# no per-run chat authorization needed. This does NOT auto-start drive (starting
# ./drive.sh stays an explicit per-feature act), never delegates the merge
# confirm, and DANGEROUS features (external write-paths) never use the driver.
YOLO=0

# --- sibling repos (drive.sh doctor) ---------------------------------------------
# PIPELINE_REPO=$HOME/workspace/pipeline
# DASHBOARD_REPO=$HOME/workspace/pipeline-dashboard
# SKILLS_DIR=$HOME/.agents/skills
